{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The secrets are growing. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide I.R.I.S., a gardening robot lost to time, to unearth the secrets of her overgrown world. Solve plant-based puzzles using your water spout, and untangle events through environmental storytelling, in this atmospheric journey<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962610/extras/36b4c6e9a070c5c395f6a680572ad88c.poster.avif?t=1760118935\" width=474 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962610/extras/36b4c6e9a070c5c395f6a680572ad88c.webm?t=1760118935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962610/extras/36b4c6e9a070c5c395f6a680572ad88c.mp4?t=1760118935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Plant-Based Puzzles</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the world by solving plant-based puzzles, and bring nature back into the uninhabitable.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962610/extras/fd943f0aaca41536956e4b14c1d6acde.poster.avif?t=1760118935\" width=450 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962610/extras/fd943f0aaca41536956e4b14c1d6acde.webm?t=1760118935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962610/extras/fd943f0aaca41536956e4b14c1d6acde.mp4?t=1760118935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Water Physics</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using her water spout, IRIS can shoot out water streams to interact with her environment. Grow plants, fill in gaps, and push objects to advance past any obstacle in your way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962610/extras/c59807946048deeafbd33e0aa1440c11.poster.avif?t=1760118935\" width=470 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962610/extras/c59807946048deeafbd33e0aa1440c11.webm?t=1760118935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962610/extras/c59807946048deeafbd33e0aa1440c11.mp4?t=1760118935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Environmental Story-telling</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what happened decades into the past as you travel across a world left in ruin.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962610/extras/0196596be952c9f558b99d9ffca44daf.poster.avif?t=1760118935\" width=386 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962610/extras/0196596be952c9f558b99d9ffca44daf.webm?t=1760118935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962610/extras/0196596be952c9f558b99d9ffca44daf.mp4?t=1760118935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962610?t=1760118935","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962610?t=1760118935","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962610/3b55201341b559d2e908cb3684942dc99b505527/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760118935","capsule_imagev5":"https: